notes.body:
I'm OK with merging this but I'd like to standardize on Fluent Icons. Here's what it looks like if I swap the capture-options, document-open, file-save, file-close, and file-reload icons with Fluent's Folder, Document, Document Dismiss, and Arrow Reset icons. Those choices aren't set in stone, but should provide a good idea of what a Fluent-ized toolbar would look like:

![fluent-toolbar](/uploads/9678f6a90d413bcae3875b8d984fa913/fluent-toolbar.png){width=900 height=97}

If you want to merge this with the current icon set I can migrate to Fluent later.

